		(property "Notes" "3V3_SLEEP pull-up: holds the TPS62177 in normal mode while U301 is in reset or unprogrammed (pins float; SLEEP pull-down 1.4 uA typ, no max). 220k gives about 0.92 x VDDS typ against VIH 0.8 x VDDS (review 4 A-1b); 15 uA while firmware drives SLEEP low in S2"
