		(property "Notes" "Battery-side ripple MLCC (C431/C434/C435 and C531/C534/C535; cost-down 2026-10-14, was 47 uF 1210): the 100 uF polymer C432/C532 carries the bulk, bank about 114 uF effective (>= 80). The worst battery-side ripple is about 1.5 A rms (reverse buck to 9 V 3 A); check their temperature at bring-up"
