		(property "Notes" "J104 overvoltage clamp (review 4 D-5): 18 V standoff, 20-22.1 V breakdown, so a bench supply left above about 22 V is clamped before it reaches the 25 V parts on PACK_P. On the header side of D104, so it draws nothing from the pack. Sacrificial: keep the bench current limit low. Cathode (pin 1) to the J104 line"
